# A Markdown file the mock model writes: its block gets the card
# `Open in Markdown ↗` in place of the old `↗ Markdown <name>`. Where it
# stands, under the headline's path, is checked by the panel's unit tests.
mock-llm
start
wait "README.md"
key Alt+A
wait "Agent"
key Alt+Home Alt+F11
type "write the stock notes"
key Enter
wait "Allow once" 20
type "1"
wait "The notes are written." 20
expect "Open in Markdown ↗"
expect-not "↗ Markdown"
snapshot card
quit
